* asbuilt_r21_10k_rail125
.include "C:/CS Projects Folder/Isolated Shunt Amplifier/hardware/review/models/LM7321_12V.lib"
* reference section, as built (R21 = 10000)
V12 v12 0 12.500
Vin vin 0 15
* ISenseRTN: 100k/100k divider, 100 nF, unity buffer U5
R22 v12 u5p 100k
R17 u5p 0 100k
C4 u5p 0 100n
XU5 u5p irtn v12 0 irtn LM7321_12V
C30 irtn 0 1.713e-05
C29 irtn vin 1.341e-05
* DiffAmpRef: second 100k/100k divider with R28 100 R in the middle, R21, 100 nF, buffer U9
R26 v12 r28a 100k
R28a r28a wiper 0.001
R28b wiper r28b 100
R29 r28b 0 100k
R21 wiper u9p 1e+04
C26 u9p 0 100n
Ios 0 u9p 0
XU9 u9p dref v12 0 dref LM7321_12V
C10 dref irtn 22u
.op
.end
